# Normalise line endings to LF inside the repo.
#
# This matters more than it looks: .github/workflows/deploy.yml contains
# `run: |` blocks that execute as bash on ubuntu runners. If the file is
# committed with CRLF (easy to do from Windows), bash sees `set -e\r` and the
# workflow fails with confusing errors. Storing LF prevents that.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep binaries byte-exact
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
